/// performed by an {@link hrm_time_tracking_employees Employee} on a
/// specific date for a given {@link hrm_time_tracking_projects Project}.
/// Each timelog records the duration in minutes, optionally links to an
/// associated {@link hrm_time_tracking_tasks Task} within that project, and
/// provides a description of the work performed. The billable flag indicates
/// whether the logged time is chargeable.
